time because exhibitionists turn it into a sideshow.  Ours,=20
however, is different.  It is informative for shareholders and=20
fun for us. (At Berkshire's meetings, the exhibitionists are on=20
the dais.)=20

     This year our meeting will be on May 23, 1988 in Omaha, and=20
we hope that you come.  The meeting provides the forum for you to=20
